grama corta la curva la curvatura es cero. As\'ED en zonas de una curva donde la curvatura es cero (segmentos de l\'EDnea recta), ambas curvas se solapan. Por otra parte en un punto esquinado la curvatura es muy alta y puede tender al infinito. Tanto cuanto m\'E1s alto es el valor absoluto de la curvatura, m\'E1s lejos de la curva se dibuja el trazo de la curvatura. Las curvas alisadas est\'E1n caracterizadas por una curvatura sin bollos ni huecos inesperadas, la curvatura debe cambiar gradualmente al igual que el caso de abajo con la l\'EDnea de flotaci\'F3n. La escala del diagrama\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd7\expndtw33  \expnd0\expndtw0 curvatura\expnd7\expndtw33  \expnd0\expndtw0 puede\expnd7\expndtw33  \expnd0\expndtw0 ser\expnd6\expndtw32  \expnd0\expndtw0 disminuida\expnd7\expndtw33  \expnd0\expndtw0 presionando\expnd7\expndtw33  \expnd0\expndtw0 la\expnd7\expndtw33  \expnd0\expndtw0 tecla\expnd7\expndtw33  \expnd0\expndtw0 F9\expnd7\expndtw33  \expnd0\expndtw0 y\expnd6\expndtw31  \expnd0\expndtw0 aumentada\expnd7\expndtw33  \expnd0\expndtw0 presionando\expnd7\expndtw33  \expnd0\expndtw0 la\expnd7\expndtw33  \expnd0\expndtw0 tecla\expnd7\expndtw33  \expnd0\expndtw0 F10.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li127\qj\sl240\slmult1\f1\fs22\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 \'A1Cerci\'F3rese\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 que\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 la\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0\cf4{\ul visibilidad\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 la\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 curvatura\expnd-1\expndtw-6}\expnd-1\expndtw-3\expnd0\expndtw0\expnd-1\expndtw-4\expnd0\expndtw0\expnd-1\expndtw-3\expnd0\expndtw0\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0\cf1 tambi\'E9n\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 est\'E9\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw-2 habilitada!\par
